{title: Kasoor}
{artist: Prateek Kuhad}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
[G]Haan, mai gumsum [C]hoon,        [G]In raahon ki [D]tarah
[G]Tere khwaabon [C]mein,        [G]Teri khwaahishon mein [D]chhupa
[Am]Na jaane [D]kyun,        Hai [G]yeh roz [D]ka silsi [Em]la
Do rooh [C]ki hai daas [D]taan,        [G]Tere zulfon ki yeh [Em]nami
Teri [C]aankhon ka yeh [G]nasha,        Yaha [G]kho bhi [D]jau toh [Em]mai
Kya [C]kasoor [D]hai [G]mera,        [G]Kyu yeh afsaa [C]ne
[G]In lamho mein kho [D]gaye,        [G]Hum ghayal [C]thhe
[G]In lafzon mein kho [D]gaye,        [Am]The hum an [D]jaane
Ab [G]dil mein [D]tum ho [Em]chhupi,        Hum hai [C]seher ki parchaai [D]yaan
[G]Tere saanson ki raat [Em]hai,        [C]Tere honthon ki hai [G]subah
Yaha [G]kho bhi [D]jau toh [Em]mai,        Kya [C]kasoor [D]hai [G]mera
